  "updated_at": "2026-03-26",
  "bio": "Mir Smith is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black & gray and dotwork, creating intricate designs with impeccable attention to detail. Based out of ILL Cosmos Tattoo in Milton, Canada, Mir combines their love for dad jokes, dogs, and Dungeons and Dragons into a friendly and welcoming atmosphere for all their clients. Their professionalism is reflected in their structured booking system, which reopens on October 1st for appointments in November, ensuring time and care is given to each tattoo session.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Milton, Ontario, Canada"
